\begin_layout Enumerate
Converts the longdist35 timetags file data,
 longdist35_V.dat,
 into csv files each containing a list of photon arrival times,
 one file for each observer.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Enumerate
Converts the longdist35_C.dat apparatus setting and photon detection outcomes into OEM csv files containg a list of integer pairs.
\end_layout

